            ]
        },
        "50_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Mugh..."
            ]
        },
        "58_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Hm, I really think it's a trap!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "6": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I knew it, now you're here too!"
            ]
        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "The spirits have been quite busy, you know."
            ]
        },
        "50_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I can't just sit around and do nothing!"
            ]
        },
        "100_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Oh, a beast youkai!"
            ]
        },
        "128_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Wait, you're that komainu, Aunn."
            ]
        },
        "136_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Komainu are the servants of gods,",
                "so I guess you <i$technically> aren't a beast youkai."
            ]
        },
        "144_0": {
            "lines": [
                "What's a shrine maiden doing in a place like this?"
            ]
        },
        "152_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Exorcising beast youkai."
            ]
        },
        "160_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Why are you doing that?"
            ]
        },
        "168_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Because they're there."
            ]
        },
        "176_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Here it is!",
                "That Gensokyo specialty, the unreasonable shrine maiden!"
            ]
        },
        "184_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I'll take you out before you take me out!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "7": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Why are shrine maidens always so violent?!"
            ]
        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "......"
            ]
        },
        "50_0": {
            "lines": [
                "What's wrong?",
