        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "The temple's rat even!"
            ]
        },
        "50_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Isn't that great? Even as a mouse"
            ]
        },
        "58_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I prefer cats, and",
                "I'm not scared of dogs."
            ]
        },
        "66_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I don't like going to the temple!",
