            ]
        }
    },
    "18": {
        "4_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Hell is really big, you know that?",
                "Where exactly are they!?"
            ]
        },
        "12_0": {
            "lines": [
                "......"
            ]
        },
        "20_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I can't hear the whispers anymore."
            ]
        },
        "28_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Which means they must be close."
            ]
        },
        "132_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Good job."
            ]
        },
        "160_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You've really helped my cause."
            ]
        },
        "168_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Ah, I think I've met you before."
            ]
        },
        "176_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Matriarch of the Kiketsu Family,",
                "Yachie Kicchou."
            ]
        },
        "184_0": {
            "lines": [
                "For your information, Son Biten is my lackey."
            ]
        },
        "192_0": {
            "lines": [
                "She did well by luring you here."
            ]
        },
        "200_0": {
            "lines": [
                "So you're saying that monkey lied to me?"
            ]
        },
        "208_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Reimu has her hands full investigating the incident."
            ]
        },
        "216_0": {
            "lines": [
                "And you're the Hakurei Shrine's guardian beast.",
                "So now that I've lured you out,"
            ]
        },
        "224_0": {
            "lines": [
                "The shrine is mine for the taking!",
                "It'll be my first step towards conquering the surface!"
            ]
        },
        "232_0": {
            "lines": [
                ".....Oh dear."
            ]
        },
        "240_0": {
            "lines": [
                "This whole time, I've had you in the palm of my hand!"
            ]
        },
        "248_0": {
            "lines": [
                "......Ah-hah-hah!"
            ]
        },
        "256_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Why are you laughing?"
            ]
        },
        "264_0": {
            "lines": [
                "What a short-sighted trap!",
                "Should have expected that from a beast."
            ]
        },
        "272_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Even if you've lured me out,",
                "the shrine won't be any different."
            ]
        },
        "280_0": {
            "lines": [
                "What?"
            ]
        },
        "288_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You didn't know?",
                "Komainu come in pairs; there are two of me!"
            ]
        },
        "296_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I see..."
            ]
        },
        "304_0": {
            "lines": [
                "T-that level of miscalculation is totally normal."
            ]
        },
        "312_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Still, I went as far as using that tube-fox to lure you out."
            ]
        },
        "320_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I only intended to capture you,",
                "but I think it's time for a change of plan."
            ]
        },
        "328_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You'll die here!"
            ]
        }
